To Save Background Sound\nIn a page, i → Save files → Save items → \nSave\n・\n\t They cannot be saved with PC Site Browser.\n・\n\t In a page with image, select \n to save sound.\n■\tTo Save Linked Files\nIn a page, highlight a link → f (Select) → \nSave\n・\n For Auto Save files, select link to save files.\n・\n\t The following operations are available when you \nhighlight a link and press f (Select) or save \na file (available options vary depending on file \ntype).\nPlay: Play file (e.g., media file) \nDisplay: Show file\nSet as: Save file to Wallpaper or Ringtone\nDetails: Show file details\nBack to browser: Return to page\n・\n If files with same name exist, notification appears, \nchoose Yes to save it with a different name. \nChoose No to edit the file name.\nBookmarks\nToggling between Yahoo! Keitai/PC Site Browser \nBookmark\nIn a page, i → Bookmarks → Open list → u \n(\n) / u (\n) \n・\n\t Alternatively, press f → Yahoo! → (PC site \nbrowser) → Bookmarks → u (\n) / u \n(\n).\nOpening Bookmarked Website\nIn a page, i → Bookmarks → Open list → \nSelect a bookmark\nSaving Bookmark by Direct Entry\nIn a page, i → Bookmarks → Open list → i \n→ Add bookmark → Select Title field → Enter \ntitle → Select URL field → Enter URL → u (Save) \n・\n\t Alternatively, press f → Yahoo! → (PC \nsite browser) → Bookmarks → i → Add \nbookmark → Select Title field → Enter title → \nSelect URL field → Enter URL → u (Save).\nEditing Bookmark Title/URL\nIn a page, i → Bookmarks → Open list → \nHighlight bookmark → i → Edit → Select Title \nfield → Edit title → Select URL field → Edit URL → \nu (Save) \n・\n\t Alternatively, press f → Yahoo! → (PC site \nbrowser) → Bookmarks → Highlight bookmark \n→ i → Edit → Select Title field → Edit title → \nSelect URL field → Edit URL → u (Save).\n\n\n5-13\nInternet Services\n5\nOpening Bookmark URL with New Tab\nIn a page, i → Bookmarks → Open list → \nHighlight bookmark → i → Open new tab\nSending Bookmark URL via S! Mail\nIn a page, i → Bookmarks → Open list \n→ Highlight bookmark → i → Send → Via \nmessage → S! Mail → Check bookmarks → u \n(Send) → (fP.4-4 S! Mail b) \n・\n\t Alternatively, press f → Yahoo! → (PC site \nbrowser) → Bookmarks → Highlight bookmark \n→ i → Send → Via message → S! Mail → \nCheck bookmarks → u (Send).\nSending Bookmark URL via SMS\nIn a page, i → Bookmarks → Open list \n→ Highlight bookmark → i → Send → Via \nmessage → SMS → (fP.4-5 SMS b) \n・\n\t Alternatively, press f → Yahoo! → (PC site \nbrowser) → Bookmarks → Highlight bookmark \n→ i → Send → Via message → SMS.\nSending Bookmark URL via Infrared\nIn a page, i → Bookmarks → Open list \n→ Highlight bookmark → i → Send → Via \ninfrared → (fP.12-3) \n・\n\t Alternatively, press f → Yahoo! → (PC site \nbrowser) → Bookmarks → Highlight bookmark \n→ i → Send → Via infrared.\nCreating Folders in Bookmark List\nIn a page, i → Bookmarks → Open list → i \n→ Create folder → Enter folder name\n・\n\t Alternatively, press f → Yahoo! → (PC site \nbrowser) → Bookmarks → i → Create \nfolder → Enter folder name.\nMoving Bookmark to Folders\nIn a page, i → Bookmarks → Open list\n■\tTo Move a Bookmark\nHighlight bookmark → i → Move → Selected \n→ Select a destination folder\n■\tTo Move Multiple Bookmarks\ni → Move → Multiple → Check bookmarks \n→ u (Move) → Select a destination folder\n■\tTo Move All Bookmarks\ni → Move → All → Select a destination \nfolder\n・\n\t Alternatively, press f → Yahoo! → (PC site \nbrowser) → Bookmarks → Highlight bookmark \n→ i → Move.\nChanging Bookmark Order\nIn a page, i → Bookmarks → Open list → \nHighlight bookmark → i → Change order → \nr to move cursor to a destination → f (Select) \n・\n\t Alternatively, press f → Yahoo! → (PC site \nbrowser) → Bookmarks → i → Change \norder → Use r to move cursor to a destination \n→ f (Select).\nChanging Bookmark Format\nIn a page, i → Bookmarks → Open list → i \n→ View by → List/List+Preview\n・Alternatively, f → Yahoo! → (PC site \nbrowser) → Bookmarks → i → View by → \nList/List+Preview.\nSaving Bookmark to Data Folder\nIn a page, i → Bookmarks → Open list → \nHighlight bookmark → i → Save to data folder \n→ Phone/Memory card → Yes\n・\n\t Alternatively, press f → Yahoo! → (PC site \nbrowser) → Bookmarks → Highlight bookmark \n→ i → Save to data folder → Phone/\nMemory card → Yes.\nViewing Bookmark Details\nIn a page, i → Bookmarks → Open list → \nHighlight bookmark → i → Details\n・\n\t Alternatively, press f → Yahoo! → (PC site \nbrowser) → Bookmarks → Highlight bookmark \n→ i → Details.\nDeleting Bookmarks\nIn a page, i → Bookmarks → Open list\n■\tTo Delete a Bookmark\nHighlight bookmark → i → Delete → \nSelected → Yes\n■\tTo Delete Multiple Bookmarks\ni → Delete → Multiple → Check bookmarks \n→ u (Delete) → Yes\n\n\n5-14\nInternet Services\n5\n■\tTo Delete All Bookmarks\ni → Delete → All → Enter Phone Password \n→ f (OK) → Yes\n・\n\t Alternatively, press f → Yahoo! → (PC site \nbrowser) → Bookmarks → Highlight bookmark \n→ i → Delete.\nSaved Pages\nToggling between Yahoo! Keitai/PC Site Browser \nSaved Page\nIn a page, i → Saved pages → Open list → u \n(\n) / u (\n) \n・\n\t Alternatively, press f → Yahoo! → (PC site \nbrowser) → Saved pages → u (\n) / u \n(\n).\nOpening Saved Pages in a Page\nIn a page, i → Saved pages → Open list → \nSelect saved pages\nRenaming Saved Pages\nIn a page, i → Saved pages → Open list → \nHighlight entry → i → Rename → Enter name\n・\n\t Alternatively, press f → Yahoo! → (PC site \nbrowser) → Saved pages → Highlight entry → \ni → Rename → Enter name.\nOpening Saved Pages URL with New Tab\nIn a page, i → Saved pages → Open list → \nHighlight saved page → i → Open new tab\nChanging Order of Saved Pages\nIn a page, i → Saved pages → Open list → \nHighlight entry → i → Change order → r to \nmove cursor to a destination → f (Select) \n・\n\t Alternatively, press f → Yahoo! → (PC site \nbrowser) → Saved pages → Highlight entry → \ni → Change order → Use r to move cursor \nto a destination → f (Select).\nChanging Saved Pages Format\nIn a page, i → Saved pages → Open list → i \n→ View by → List/List+Preview\n・Alternatively, f → Yahoo! → (PC site \nbrowser) → Saved pages → i → Open list \n→ List/List+Preview.\nDeleting Saved Pages\nIn a page, i → Saved pages → Open list\n■\tTo Delete an Item\nHighlight entry → i → Delete → Selected → \nYes\n■\tTo Delete Multiple Items\ni → Delete → Multiple → Check entries → \nu (Delete) → Yes\n■\tTo Delete All Items\ni → Delete → All → Enter Phone Password \n→ f (OK) → Yes\n・\n\t Alternatively, press f → Yahoo! → Saved \npages → Highlight entry → i → Delete.\n\n\n5-15\nInternet Services\n5\nRSS\nSorting RSS\nf → Yahoo! → PC site browser → RSS feed \n→ Highlight RSS → i → Change order → Use \nr to move cursor to desired location → f (Select) \nMoving RSS to Folder\nf → Yahoo! → PC site browser → RSS feed\n■\tTo Move an Item\nHighlight RSS → i → Move → Selected → \nSelect folder\n■\tTo Move Multiple Items\ni → Move → Multiple → Check RSS → u \n(Move) → Select folder\n■\tTo Move All Items\ni → Move → All → Select folder\nProhibiting RSS Update\nf → Yahoo! → PC site browser → RSS feed\n■\tTo Prohibit an Item\nHighlight RSS → i → Restrict update → \nSelected\n■\tTo Prohibit Multiple Items\ni → Restrict update → Multiple → Check \nRSS → u (Save) \n■\tTo Prohibit All Items\ni → Restrict update → All\n・\n\t Repeat setting operation to cancel Restrict \nupdate. \nCreating Folders in RSS List\nf → Yahoo! → PC site browser → RSS feed \n→ i → Create folder → Enter folder name\nChanging RSS Folder Name\nf → Yahoo! → PC site browser → RSS feed \n→ Highlight folder → i → Rename folder → \nEnter name\nDeleting RSS Folder\nf → Yahoo! → PC site browser → RSS feed \n→ Highlight folder → i → Delete folder → Yes\nSending RSS via Message \nf → Yahoo! → PC site browser → RSS feed \n→ Highlight RSS → i → Send → Via message \n→ (fP.4-4 S! Mail b) \nSending RSS via Infrared\nf → Yahoo! → PC site browser → RSS feed \n→ Highlight RSS → i → Send → Via infrared \n(fP.12-3) \nSaving RSS to Data Folder\nf → Yahoo! → PC site browser → RSS feed \n→ i → Export → Phone/Memory card → Yes\n・\n\t The save location can be set to Memory Card if \ninserted.\nLoading RSS\nf → Yahoo! → PC site browser → RSS feed \n→ i → Import → Select file\n■\tTo Add RSS Feed\nAdd → Yes/No\n■\tTo Delete All & Add RSS Feed\nDelete all & Overwrite → Enter Phone \nPassword → f (OK) → Yes\n・\n After saving, update confirmation appears. Choose \nYes to update.\nViewing RSS Details\nf → Yahoo! → PC site browser → RSS feed \n→ Highlight RSS → i → Details\nDeleting RSS\nf → Yahoo! → PC site browser → RSS feed\n■\tTo Delete an Item\nHighlight RSS → i → Delete → Selected → \nYes\n■\tTo Delete Multiple Items\ni → Delete → Multiple → Check RSS → u \n(Delete) → Yes\n■\tTo Delete All Items\ni → Delete → All → Enter Phone Password \n→ f (OK) → Yes\n・\n\t Alternatively, highlight folder → i → Delete all \n→ Enter Phone Password → f (OK) → Yes.\n\n\n6\n\t \t Camera & Imaging\nCapturing Image, Recording Video & Editing ....................................... 6-2\nCamera................................................................................................... 6-3\nUsing Display as Viewfinder.\n..........................................................................6-3\nSingle Shot.\n...................................................................................................6-5\nNormal.........................................................................................................6-6\nScene.\n...........................................................................................................6-6\nMulti Shot.\n....................................................................................................6-6\nPhoto Combination.......................................................................................6-7\nViewing Captured Images (Quick Play) .\n.........................................................6-7\nVideo.........................