......7-8\nAdvanced Settings.\n................................................................................. 7-8\nMusic Playback.............................................................................................7-8\nMovie Playback.............................................................................................7-9\nPlaylist........................................................................................................7-10\n\n\n7-2\nMedia Player\n7\nUsing Media Player\nThis handset features a Media Player. \nDownload media files via Yahoo! Keitai or create personal playlists.\nPlaying Media Files\nCreating Playlists\nPlay music or movies via Media Player (fP.7-4, P.7-7).\nSelect a music or movie file from folders or playlists.\nAdd your favorite music or movies to a playlist and \ncreate your own music or movie album (fP.7-8).\nM\nE\nD\nI\nA\n \nP\nL\nA\nY\nE\nR\nMy Playlist\nM\nE\nD\nI\nA\n \nP\nL\nA\nY\nE\nR\nMy Playlist\nDownloading Media Files\nAccess\nDownload\nAccess Yahoo! Keitai to download music or movies\n (fP.7-3).\nSaving Music/Movie from PC to Memory Card\nInsert Memory Card with music or movies on it that \nwas saved on PC into the handset (fP.7-3).\nInsert\n\n\n7-3\nMedia Player\n7\nDownloading Media Files\nAccess Yahoo! Keitai to download music or movies \nand copy them to handset.\nNote\n・\n\t\nDownloading music or movies may incur \nhigh Packet Communication charges since \nthey contain a large volume of data.\nDownloading Music & Movies\na\tf → Media\nb\tDownload music or movie\n■\t To Download Music\nMusic → All music → Download \nMusic\n■\t To Download Movie\nMovie → All movies → Download \nMovies\nSaving Media Files to Phone/Memory \nCard\nTo convert music or movie file formats, software is \nrequired.\n・\n\t SoftBank Mobile does not guarantee proper \noperation with any specific software.\n・\n\t For software specifications or operations, see \nSoftBank Mobile Website.\na\tInsert Memory Card into handset\n・\n\tFollow instructions (fP.11-8).\n・\n Save files to the following folders by type: \n Music file: PRIVATE/MYFOLDER/My Items/Music \n\t\nPRIVATE/MYFOLDER/My Items/Sounds  \n\t\n& Ringtones\n Movie file: PRIVATE/MYFOLDER/My Items/Movie\n・\n After saving files, insert Memory Card into \nhandset; load files to play them.\nPlaying Music\nFolder structure is as follows.\nFolder\nDescription\nLast played/Now \nplaying\nLast/currently playing file \nAll music\nUp to 9999 music files\nPlaylists\nView playable files in Music in \ncreated folders\nArtists\nAll music files by Artist\nAlbums\nAll music files by Album\nGenres\nAll music files by Genre\nFolders\nAll music files in Ring songs・\ntones and Music folders in \nData Folder\nRecently played \nmusic\n100 most recently played files \n(most recent first) \nMost played music\n100 most frequently played \nfiles (most frequent first) \n・\n\tFiles on Memory Card may take longer to load.\n・\n Only files playable via Music appear.\n\n\n7-4\nMedia Player\n7\nMedia Player Music Window\nMusic Playback\na\nb\nc\nd\nl\nk\ne\nf\nh\ng\ni\nj\na Title (file name when title is unknown) \nb\tArtist's name\nc File number/Total number of files\nd\tCopyright protection\ne\tPlaying status: Play/Pause/Stop\nf\tElapsed playing time\ng\tVolume level\nh Shuffle\ni\tRepeat mode\n : Off\n : One\n : All\nj\tTotal playing time\nk\tRepeat section\nl\tProgress bar\nShortcut Key Operations\nPress shortcut assigned key to perform the operation.\nAvailable operations vary according to playing status \nand file type.\nKey\nDescription\nf\nPlay/Pause\nd\nNext song\na\nPrevious song/Beginning of current song\nw\nVolume up\nx\nVolume down\nu\nStop/Set as\ni\nMenu\n1\nRepeat pattern setting\n2\nShuffle\n4\nTime search\n5\nRepeat section\n・\n Shortcuts may not work with some music files.\nPlaying Music\na\tf → Media → Music\nb\tPlay a file\n■\t To Play Most Recently Played File\nLast played\n・\n\tWhile playing, Last played will be Now \nplaying.\n■\t To Select from All Files\nAll music → Select a file\n■\t To Select from Playlists\nPlaylists → Select a playlist → Select a file\n■\t To Select from Artists List\nArtists → Select an Artist → Select a file\n■\t To Select from Albums List\nAlbums → Select an Album → Select a file\n■\t To Select from Genres list\nGenres → Select a genre → Select a file\n■\t To Select from Folder List\nFolders → Select a folder → Select a file\n■\t To Select from Recent Music List\nRecently played music → Select a file\n■\t To Select from Most Played Music List\nMost played music → Select a file\n\n\n7-5\nMedia Player\n7\n・\n When Memory Card is inserted, Memory Card files \nappear in file list with .\n・\n\tWhile Media Player is active, press c repeatedly \nto hide Music playback window.  \nIn Standby, press y to end Media Player. Stop \nconfirmation appears, choose Yes.\n・\n\tIf a call arrives while playing music in Music \nplayback window, playback pauses and handset \nrings. After call ends, paused Music playback \nwindow returns. \n・\n\tWhen Alarm is activated while music is being \nplayed in Music playback window, playback \npauses, Alarm sounds and indicator appears. Press \nany key to stop Alarm and to clear the indicator. \nAdvanced\nbrP.7-8\n●\n●Searching File by Text\n●\n●Sending Files\n●\n●Sorting Files\n●\n●Purchasing/Downloading Content Key\n●\n●Viewing File Details\n●\n●Playing from Specified Point\n●\n●Viewing Lyrics\n●\n●Connecting to Web Link\n●\n●Checking Shortcut Key Assignments\ns\n●\n●Set Repeat Mode (rP.13-19) \n●\n●Set Shuffle (rP.13-19) \nPlaying Movie\nFolder structure is as follows.\nFolder\nDescription\nLast played\nPlay most recently played file\nAll movies\nView all playable files in Movie \nup to 9999\nPlaylists\nView playable files in Movie in \ncreated folders\nFolders\nView files in Movie folders in \nData Folder\nRecently played \nmovies\nView up to 100 most recently \nplayed files (most recently played \nfile appears first) \nMost played \nmovies\nView up to 100 most