d) (fP.12-3) \nSorting Files\nf → Media → Music → All music → i → \nSort by → Select an item\n・\n Perform the same operation on files in Folders.\n・\n While loading files from Memory Card, the order of \nmusic files may not be changed. Perform the same \noperation again.\n\n\n7-9\nMedia Player\n7\nPurchasing/Downloading Content Key\nf → Media → Music → All music → \nHighlight a file → i → Download Content key \n→ Yes\nViewing File Details\nf → Media → Music → All music → \nHighlight a file → i → Details \n・\n\t Alternatively, during playback, press i → \nDetails.\n・\n\t Perform the same operation in other folders.\nPlaying from Specified Point\nIn Music playback window, i → Time search → \nEnter time → f (Jump) \nViewing Lyrics\nIn Music playback window, i → View lyrics\n・\n Only available for compatible files.\nConnecting to Web Link\nIn Music playback window, i → Connect web \nlink → Yes\n・\n\t Unavailable if web link does not exist.\nChecking Shortcut Key Assignments\nIn Music playback window, i → Help\nMovie Playback\nSetting Files to Ringtone in Normal Mode\nf → Media → Movie → All movies → \nHighlight a file → u (Set as) \n・\n Only available for compatible files.\nSearching Files by Text\nf → Media → Movie → All movies → i \n→ Search files → Select search field → Enter title \nor author's name → Check Title or Author \n→ u (Search) \nSending Files\nf → Media → Movie → All movies → \nHighlight a file → i → Send\n■\tTo Send via Message\nVia message → (fP.4-4 S! Mail b) \n■\tTo Send via Infrared\nVia infrared → Check files → u (Send) (fP.12-3) \nSorting Files\nf → Media → Movie → All movies → i → \nSort by → Select an item\n・\n Perform the same operation on files in Folders.\nPurchasing/Downloading Content Key\nf → Media → Movie → All movies → Highlight \na file → i → Download Content key → Yes\nViewing File Details\nf → Media → Movie → All movies → \nHighlight a file → i → Details \n・\n\t Alternatively, in Movie playback window (Portrait \nview), press i → Details.\n・\n\t Perform the same operation in other folders.\nChanging Window Size\nf → Media → Settings → Movie settings → \nDisplay → First view → Select an item\nChanging Window Size\nIn Movie playback window (Portrait view), i → \nResolution → Select an item\n・\n To view movie in fullscreen, the file has to be 320 x \n192 resolution. \nPlaying from Specified Point\nIn Movie playback window (Portrait view), i → \nTime search → Enter time → f (Jump) \nCapturing Still Image from Movie\nIn Movie playback window (Portrait view), i → \nCapture frame\nConnecting to Web Link\nIn Movie playback window (Portrait view), i → \nConnect web link → Yes \nChanging Playback Speed\nIn Movie playback window (Portrait view), i → \nPlayback speed → Select an item\n・\n\t Sound is muted while changing playback speed.\n\n\n7-10\nMedia Player\n7\nChecking Shortcut Key Assignments\nIn Movie playback window (Portrait view), i → \nHelp \nPlaylist\nAdding Files to Playlist\nf → Media → Music/Movie → All music/All \nmovies \n■\tTo Add an Item\nHighlight a file → i → Add to playlist → \nSelected → Select a playlist\n■\tTo Add Multiple Items\ni → Add to playlist → Multiple → Check \nfiles → u (Add) → Select a playlist\nRemoving Files from Playlist\nf → Media → Music/Movie → Playlists → \nSelect a playlist\n■\tTo Remove an Item\nHighlight a file → i → Remove → Selected\n■\tTo Remove Multiple Items\ni → Remove → Multiple → Check files → \nu (Remove) \n■\tTo Remove All Items\ni → Remove → All → Yes\nChanging Order of Files in Playlist\nf → Media → Music/Movie → Playlists \n→ Select a playlist → Highlight a file → i → \nChange order → Highlight a destination with r \n→ f (OK) \nRenaming Playlist\nf → Media → Music/Movie → Playlists → \nHighlight a playlist → i → Rename → Enter \nplaylist name\nDeleting Playlist\nf → Media → Music/Movie → Playlists \n■\tTo Delete an Item\nHighlight a playlist → i → Delete → \nSelected → Yes\n■\tTo Delete Multiple Items\ni → Delete → Multiple → Check playlists → \nu (Delete) → Yes\n・\n\t If all playlists are checked, enter Phone \nPassword.\n■\tTo Delete All Items\ni → Delete → All → Yes\n\n\n8\n\t \t Entertainment\nEntertainment Functions........................................................................ 8-2\nS! Information Channel (Japanese) ....................................................... 8-3\nService Registration.\n......................................................................................8-3\nNew Received Information.\n............................................................................8-3\nUsing Weather Indicator.\n...............................................................................8-3\nS! Quick News (Japanese)...................................................................... 8-3\nOpening List.\n.................................................................................................8-3\nViewing Update Information.\n.........................................................................8-4\nRegistering S! Quick News List......................................................................8-4\nRefreshing Entries Manually..........................................................................8-4\nDeleting Entries.\n............................................................................................8-4\nFree Contents (Japanese) ...................................................................... 8-5\nAdvanced Settings.\n................................................................................. 8-5\nS! Information Channel.................................................................................8-5\nS! Quick News..............................................................................................8-6\n\n\nEntertainment\n8-2\n8\nEntertainment Functions\nAccess the Internet to view or download content. Subscribe to content for automatic updates. Learn how to download and use content.\nNote\nThese services require separate \nsubscriptions: \n・\n\t\nS! Quick News\n・\n\t\nS! Information Channel/Weather\nS! Quick News (fP.8-3) \nNEWS\nNEWS\nView Yahoo! Keitai content \nupdate information.\nFree Contents (fP.8-5) \nAccess free content.\nS! Information Channel/Weather (fP.8-3) \nJ\nDelivers subscribed content such \nas overnight news. Weather \nIndicator appears in Standby.\n\n\n8-3\nEntertainment\n8\nS! Information Channel (Japanese) \nS! Information Channel delivers subscribed \ncontents such as overnight news. Weather \nIndicator appears in Standby.\n・\n This service is only available in Japan.\n・\n\tS! Information Channel requires separate \nsubscription.\nNote\n・\n\t\nUsing S! Information Channel incurs Packet \nCommunication charges.\nService Registration\na\tf → Entertainment \n→ S! Information Channel/\nWeather → Registration/Cancel\nb\tFollow onscreen instructions\nNew Received Information\nS! Information Channel contents is received \nautomatically; notification appears in Standby.\na\tSelect a notification\nb\tFollow onscreen instructions\n・\n\tOperations are same as Yahoo! Keitai.\nUsing Weather Indicator\nUpon subscription to S! Information Channel, \nWeather Indicator appears in Standby.\n : Clear (daytime) \n : Clear (nighttime) \n : Cloudy\n : Rain\n : Snow\n : Thunderstorm\n : Later\n : Intermittent\nExample : \n \n \n → Cloudy, Intermittent rain\n・\n\tIn addition to the above, other information such as \nrainfall probability or seasonal information appears.\nAdvanced\ns\n●\n●Set Weather Indicator Display Settings (rP.13-20) \n●\n●Set Weather Indicator Update Notification \n(rP.13-20) \n●\n●Set Weather Indicator Automatic Update (rP\n.13-20) \nS! Quick News (Japanese)\nView Yahoo! Keitai content update information.\n・\n\tS! Quick News requires separate subscription.\nOpening List\na\tf → Entertainment → S! Quick \nNews\n : Unread Special News\n : Unread News Flash\n : Unread General News\n : Read Special News\n : Read News Flash\n : Read General news\nS! Quick\nNews List\nNote\n・\n\t\nUsing S! Quick News incurs Packet \nCommunication charges.\n\n\n8-4\nEntertainment\n8\nViewing Update Information\na\tf → Entertainment → S! Quick \nNews\nb\tSelect content\nc\tSelect an entry\n・\n\tPress u (Back) to return to S! Quick \nNews/Contents list.\n・\n\tTo connect to Internet and check for \nupdate, select an item → Yes.\nRegistering S! Quick News List\nRegister up to one special and five general news/\nnewsflash in S! Quick News list. \na\tf → Entertainment → S! Quick \nNews \nb\tRegister contents → Yes \nc\tSelect content → Follow onscreen \ninstructions\nRefreshing Entries Manually\na\tf → Entertainment → S! Quick \nNews\nb\tUpdate Contents\n■\t To Refresh Content\nHighlight content → u (Update) → \nSelected\n■\t To Refresh Multiple Contents\nu (Update) → Multiple → Check \ncontents → u (Update) \n■\t To Refresh All Contents\nu (Update) → All\n・\n\tPress i (Cancel) / c to cancel update \nin process.\nDeleting Entries\na\tf → Entertainment → S! Quick \nNews\nb\tDelete Contents\n■\t To Delete Content\nHighlight content → i → Delete → \nSelected → Yes\n■\t To Delete Multiple Contents\ni → Delete → Multiple → Check \ncontents → u (Delete) → Yes\n■\t To Delete All Contents\ni → Delete → All → Enter Phone \nPassword → f (OK) → Yes\nAdvanced\nbrP.8-6\n●\n●Viewing Content Details\n●\n●Refreshing S! Quick News List\n●\n●Viewing S! Quick News from List\n\n\n8-5\nEntertainment\n8\nFree Contents (Japanese) \nAccess free contents.\na\tf → Entertainment → Free \nContents\nb\tTada-Deco (Graphic Mail) → Follow \nonscreen instructions\nNote\n・\n\t\nUsing Free Contents incurs Packet \nCommunication charges.\nAdvanced Settings\nS! Information Channel\nViewing after Indicator Disappears\nf → Entertainment → S! Information \nChannel/Weather → What's new?\nViewing Information Previously Received\nf → Entertainment → S! Information \nChannel/Weather → History → Select an item\nReceiving Disrupted Information Again\nf → Entertainment → S! Information \nChannel/Weather → Get latest contents → Yes\nShowing Weather Indicator\nf → Entertainment → S! Information \nChannel/Weather → Weather Indicator → \nWeather\nUpdating Weather Indicator Manually\nf → Entertainment → S! Information \nChannel/Weather → Weather Indicator → \nManual update → Yes\nChanging Settings for Weather Indicator\nf → Entertainment → S! Information \nChannel/Weather → Weather Indicator → \nSettings\n■\tTo Change Display Settings\nDisplay setting → On/Off\n■\tTo Change Missed Event Settings\nMissed event setting → On/Off\n■\tTo Set Auto Update\nAuto update → On/Off\n\n\n8-6\nEntertainment\n8\nS! Quick News\nViewing Content Details\nIn S! Quick News list, highlight content → i → \nDetails\nRefreshing S! Quick News List\nIn S! Quick News list, select content → Highlight \nitem → i → Update\n・\n Press i (Cancel) / c to cancel.\nViewing S! Quick News from List\nIn S! Quick News list, select content → Highlight item \n→ i → Access to web → Yes\n・\n Press i (Cancel) / c to view S! Quick News \nList.\nUpdating S! Quick News List Automatically\nf → Entertainment → S! Quick News → i \n→ Settings → Auto update\n■\tTo Update Newsflash Automatically\nFlash news → Select an item\n■\tTo Update General News Automatically\nGeneral → On or Off\n■\tTo Update Special Automatically\nSpecial → On or Off\n・\n Auto update is executed based on a set time.\nTo view next update time, in S! Quick News list, \nhighlight content → i → Details.\n・\n Set General to On to update automatically once a day.\n・\n Setting Special to On may incur high Packet \nCommunication charges.\n・\n Set Special to On to update automatically once \nevery four hours.\n・\n Special and Flash news auto update is not \nexecuted between midnight and early a.m. If \nGeneral is set, news is updated automatically \nduring that period.\n・\n Auto update is not performed while roaming. \nInstead, update manually (fP.8-4).\n・\n Auto update may fail outside service area or where \nsignal conditions are poor.\n・\n If auto update fails, update ne